            <li><strong>Stack:</strong> Java, Spring Boot, Maven, Vue.js, Node.js, TypeScript, Python, Flask, PostgreSQL, MySQL, Redis, Docker, Kubernetes, GitLab CI, New Relic, Grafana, Sentry, AWS, GCP</li>
